   "source": [
    "Hamming(7,4) on Hardware"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a930b66e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Hamming(7,4) on IBM Quantum hardware**\n",
    "\n",
    "Same problem construction as `run_Hamming_74` above, but the optimisation and\n",
    "sampling run on a real QPU: SPSA instead of SciPy (one job per step rather than\n",
    "one per parameter), a single transpilation against the device at\n",
    "`optimization_level=3` with the Hamiltonian mapped through the chosen layout, and\n",
